                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#bdcb4c' fontname='Segoe UI'>Dashboard Functionality:</run>
                    <run lmargin='555' rmargin='555'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#252423' fontname='Segoe UI' lmargin='555' rmargin='555'>Click on the &quot;ℹ️&quot; Button: View all instructions and information for this dashboard and click on  &quot;</run>
