                    <run fontcolor='#252423' fontname='Segoe UI' lmargin='555' rmargin='555'>Dataset : Use this slicer to slice the data for respective dataset.</run>
                    <run lmargin='555' rmargin='555'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#252423' fontname='Segoe UI' lmargin='555' rmargin='555'>Time Period : Use this slicer to dynamically switch between different time period like CM, QTD, YTD etc.</run>
                    <run lmargin='555' rmargin='555'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#252423' fontname='Segoe UI' lmargin='555' rmargin='555'>Scroll Bars: Enabled when there is more data to be displayed on the chart.</run>
